      "title": "National Princess Day",
      "message": "I wanted to make a special place where you could look back years from now at all the memories we shared together. Every week I'll add new notes of the experiences we shared togehter, special moments, or the wonderful things you made me feel. I'll also update the website throughout our time together to add more features, outfits, and collectibles for you to explore. Every success I have in my life is genuinely because of you. I'm motivated to be a better man everyday so I can serve you to the best of my ability. Thank you my princess for choosing to be my girl. I promise I'll spend the rest of my life in service of my goddess. AKA my pretty little dictator. 🎀",
